{
  "info": {
    "name": "Vet Prescription Builder + Consultation Form Builder (#117)",
    "description": "Covers the #117 changes, updated for the design's later evolution (see testing.md's 'Scope note 2'): (1) owner-scoped consultation-form-template CRUD, including the 'a select field needs at least one option' validation AND the new is_default 'exactly one default per vet' clearing behavior; (2) the trimmed medication-catalog create/update payload (name/type/price only - no dose/frequency, dropped by migration 20260929233); (3) the new owner-scoped prescription-template CRUD (GET/POST /veterinary/prescription-templates, PATCH/DELETE /veterinary/prescription-templates/:id); (4) the widened PATCH /veterinary/consultations/:id (medications gain medicine_type/frequency/duration, plus the form_responses array - which is now where vitals/diagnosis-equivalent data lives, since the old fixed vitals/diagnosis fields were removed client-side); (5) the two new staff-facing 'every patient' list endpoints (GET /veterinary/prescriptions kept; GET /veterinary/consultation-results REMOVED this pass, now 404s same as the already-removed GET /veterinary/procedure-catalog); (6) the two new customer-facing, ownership-checked pet-history endpoints (GET /pets/:id/prescriptions, GET /pets/:id/consultation-results - unaffected by this pass, still live), including the 403 a non-owning customer gets.\n\nFill in every blank variable before running. `vet_booking_id` must be an already checked-in (status 'In Progress') or walk-in Veterinary booking made TODAY, so it shows up in the consultation queue's auto-vivify step - `owner_customer_identifier`/`owner_customer_password` must be the customer who owns that booking's pet. Run requests in order, top to bottom.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "vet_identifier", "value": "" },
    { "key": "vet_password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "receptionist_identifier", "value": "" },
    { "key": "receptionist_password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "owner_customer_identifier", "value": "" },
    { "key": "owner_customer_password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "other_customer_identifier", "value": "" },
    { "key": "other_customer_password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "vet_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "receptionist_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "owner_customer_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "other_customer_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "vet_booking_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "consultation_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "pet_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "template_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "default_template_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "medication_catalog_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "prescription_template_id", "value": "" }
  ],
